{"seeAlsoSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/AncestorsView","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/DescendantsView","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/CyclicHierarchy","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/HierarchyError"],"generated":true,"anchor":"Building-Hierarchies","title":"Building Hierarchies"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule"]]},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/ChildOf","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"sections":[],"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Structure","symbolKind":"struct","remoteSource":{"url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/ECS\/blob\/main\/Sources\/WorldModule\/Hierarchy.swift#L51","fileName":"Hierarchy.swift"},"title":"ChildOf","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"ChildOf"}],"modules":[{"name":"WorldModule"}],"externalID":"s:11WorldModule7ChildOfV","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"ChildOf","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol"},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/worldmodule\/childof"]}],"topicSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/ChildOf\/init()","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/ChildOf\/init(from:)"],"generated":true,"anchor":"Initializers","title":"Initializers"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/ChildOf\/isExclusive","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/ChildOf\/onTargetDespawn"],"generated":true,"anchor":"Type-Properties","title":"Type Properties"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/ChildOf\/Equatable-Implementations","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/ChildOf\/Relation-Implementations"],"generated":true,"anchor":"Default-Implementations","title":"Default Implementations"}],"relationshipsSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Relation","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/s15BitwiseCopyableP","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/Se","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/SE","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/SQ","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/SH","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/s16SendableMetatypeP"],"type":"conformsTo","kind":"relationships","title":"Conforms To"}],"kind":"symbol","primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"@frozen","kind":"attribute"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"ChildOf","kind":"identifier"}],"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["Linux"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"mentions":["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/SavingAndLoadingWorlds"],"kind":"mentions"},{"content":[{"level":2,"text":"Overview","anchor":"overview","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"A hierarchy groups entities into trees: a ship and its turrets, a menu and its buttons. Each","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"entity has at most one parent, and despawning a parent despawns its children, and theirs in","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"turn. Build a hierarchy with ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World\/addChild(_:to:)","isActive":true},{"text":", which refuses a link that would make","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"an entity its own ancestor, and walk it with ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World\/parent(of:)","isActive":true},{"text":",","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World\/children(of:)","isActive":true},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World\/ancestors(of:)","isActive":true},{"text":" and ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World\/descendants(of:)","isActive":true},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The following example attaches a turret and an engine to a ship, then despawns the ship,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"which takes its parts with it:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["var world = World()","let ship = world.spawn(Name(value: \"Ship\"))","let turret = world.spawn(Name(value: \"Turret\"))","let engine = world.spawn(Name(value: \"Engine\"))","try world.addChild(turret, to: ship)","try world.addChild(engine, to: ship)","","let parts = world.children(of: ship).map { world[Name.self, of: $0].value }","print(parts)","\/\/ Prints \"[\"Turret\", \"Engine\"]\"","","world.despawn(ship)","print(world.contains(engine))","\/\/ Prints \"false\""]},{"inlineContent":[{"code":"ChildOf","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is a ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Relation","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" like any other, so an entity with a parent holds a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"Targets<ChildOf>","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" component naming it. Queries use that to find the entities at each level","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"of a tree:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":".related(ChildOf.self, to: parent)","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" keeps the children of "},{"code":"parent","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":".with(Targets<ChildOf>.self)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" keeps entities that have a parent.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".without(Targets<ChildOf>.self)"},{"type":"text","text":" keeps the roots."}]}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["var world = World()","let menu = world.spawn(Name(value: \"Menu\"))","let play = world.spawn(Name(value: \"Play\"))","let quit = world.spawn(Name(value: \"Quit\"))","try world.addChild(play, to: menu)","try world.addChild(quit, to: menu)","","print(world.query(Name.self).related(ChildOf.self, to: menu).count)","\/\/ Prints \"2\"","print(world.query(Name.self).without(Targets<ChildOf>.self).count)","\/\/ Prints \"1\""]}],"kind":"content"}],"abstract":[{"text":"The relation that links a child entity to its parent.","type":"text"}],"references":{"doc://WorldModule/documentation/WorldModule/World/addChild(_:to:)":{"abstract":[{"text":"Adds an entity to the end of another entity’s children.","type":"text"}],"role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World\/addChild(_:to:)","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"addChild","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"Entity","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:11WorldModule6EntityV"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"to"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:11WorldModule6EntityV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Entity"},{"kind":"text","text":") "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"throws"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:11WorldModule15CyclicHierarchyV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"CyclicHierarchy"},{"kind":"text","text":")"}],"title":"addChild(_:to:)","url":"\/documentation\/worldmodule\/world\/addchild(_:to:)","type":"topic"},"doc://WorldModule/s8SendableP":{"title":"Swift.Sendable","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/s8SendableP","type":"unresolvable"},"doc://WorldModule/documentation/WorldModule/World/descendants(of:)":{"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/worldmodule\/world\/descendants(of:)","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/